        "profile": "At 180 Degrees Consulting, led the architecture for a product-startup client's hierarchical agent workflows (PostgreSQL for persistent storage and retrieval across agent sessions), demoed it live (5-star rating from senior leadership) and contributed to the client's production TypeScript/Node.js MCP server (OpenAI-based query generation), now in live use. Uses Claude Code, Cursor and Codex daily. Builds deployable ML models: forecasting (an LSTM time-series service), propensity modelling (an XGBoost churn classifier with Bayesian tuning and SMOTE) and customer segmentation (k-means, HAC and DBSCAN). Production LLM agent work on an AstraZeneca-affiliated multi-omics research platform."
